The menu is built with z88dk (https://github.com/z88dk/z88dk). Tapes, snapshots and Z-machine
stories are started with the loaders of NextZXOS and with ZXZVM, which are on the SD card of the
Next and are not part of NEXTflix. ZX Spectrum Next is a trademark of SpecNext Ltd; NEXTflix is
not affiliated with it.
